{"kp_id": "zj-011.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-011", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "胸部穴先定天突与鸠尾两端，再折量中间（玉堂、华盖等）；辅助穴临床少用。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.cv22", "acupoint.cv15"], "chapter_id": "zj-011.c01", "evidence_quote": "但是先找到天突，再找到九尾这两个穴道", "seg_from": 16, "seg_to": 68, "start_s": 79.57, "end_s": 384.61, "citation": {"youtube_id": "U3cEczrIZfQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U3cEczrIZfQ&t=79s", "series": "zj", "episode": 11, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 11", "start_s": 79.57, "end_s": 384.61}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "九尾=鸠尾", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-011.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-011", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "膻中：两乳连线中点，气会；治气逆、咳嗽、心胸痛。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.cv17"], "chapter_id": "zj-011.c01", "evidence_quote": "两两乳头的，中间的一点叫痰中", "seg_from": 22, "seg_to": 45, "start_s": 110.05, "end_s": 238.705, "citation": {"youtube_id": "U3cEczrIZfQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U3cEczrIZfQ&t=110s", "series": "zj", "episode": 11, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 11", "start_s": 110.05, "end_s": 238.71}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "痰中=膻中", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-011.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-011", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "心痛常用组合：天突、膻中/鸠尾（心募）、关元（小肠募，心与小肠表里）。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.cv22", "acupoint.cv4", "disease.xin_tong"], "chapter_id": "zj-011.c01", "evidence_quote": "这三个穴道我们下完针，以后病人的心痛基本上都去掉", "seg_from": 77, "seg_to": 89, "start_s": 421.72, "end_s": 537.69, "citation": {"youtube_id": "U3cEczrIZfQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U3cEczrIZfQ&t=421s", "series": "zj", "episode": 11, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 11", "start_s": 421.72, "end_s": 537.69}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
